{"key":"u13-apphycem-mcq-005-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"+40 V/m for 0 < x < 0.20 m, then −30 V/m for 0.20 m < x < 0.50 m","working":"For a straight-line potential segment, E_x = -dV/dx = -ΔV/Δx. From x=0 to x=0.20 m: ΔV = 2 - 10 = -8 V, Δx = 0.20 m, so E_x = -(-8/0.20) = +40 V/m. From x=0.20 m to x=0.50 m: ΔV = 11 - 2 = 9 V, Δx = 0.30 m, so E_x = -(9/0.30) = -30 V/m.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":551,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":39,"cacheReadTokens":512},"outputTokens":551,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":192,"reasoningTokens":359},"totalTokens":1102,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":551,"completion_tokens":551,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":512,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":39,"total_tokens":1102,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":512},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":359}},"reasoningTokens":359,"cachedInputTokens":512},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4756,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"u13-apphycem-mcq-006-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"D","final_answer":"E_x is zero at both points and positive between them","working":"The electric field component in one dimension is related to the potential by E_x = -dV/dx. At stationary points (a local maximum at x = 1.0 m and a local minimum at x = 3.0 m), the derivative dV/dx is zero, which means E_x = 0 at both x = 1.0 m and x = 3.0 m. Between a local maximum and the next local minimum with no other critical points, V(x) is strictly decreasing, meaning dV/dx < 0. Consequently, E_x = -dV/dx > 0 (positive) throughout the interval (1.0 m, 3.0 m). Therefore, choice D is correct.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":436,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":436,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":516,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":201,"reasoningTokens":315},"totalTokens":952,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":315,"promptTokenCount":436,"candidatesTokenCount":201,"totalTokenCount":952,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":436}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":201}]},"reasoningTokens":315,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3206,"keyed_label":"D"}
{"key":"u13-apphycem-mcq-005-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"+40 V/m for 0 < x < 0.20 m, then −30 V/m for 0.20 m < x < 0.50 m","working":"The x-component of the electric field is related to electric potential by E_x = -dV/dx. For straight-line segments, E_x = -ΔV/Δx.\n\nFor 0 < x < 0.20 m:\nΔV = 2 V - 10 V = -8 V\nΔx = 0.20 m - 0 m = 0.20 m\nE_x = -(-8 V / 0.20 m) = +40 V/m.\n\nFor 0.20 m < x < 0.50 m:\nΔV = 11 V - 2 V = +9 V\nΔx = 0.50 m - 0.20 m = 0.30 m\nE_x = -(+9 V / 0.30 m) = -30 V/m.\n\nThis uniquely matches choice B.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":524,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":524,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":1036,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":291,"reasoningTokens":745},"totalTokens":1560,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":745,"promptTokenCount":524,"candidatesTokenCount":291,"totalTokenCount":1560,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":524}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":291}]},"reasoningTokens":745,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":6753,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"u13-apphycem-mcq-007-v3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"A","final_answer":"4/3","working":"The capacitance of an ideal parallel-plate capacitor with vacuum between the plates is given by C = ε₀ A / d. For Capacitor 1, the area of the circular plates is A₁ = πR² and the separation is d₁ = d, giving C₁ = ε₀πR²/d. For Capacitor 2, the area is A₂ = π(2R)² = 4πR² and the separation is d₂ = 3d, giving C₂ = ε₀(4πR²)/(3d) = (4/3)C₁. Thus, the ratio C₂/C₁ = 4/3.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":389,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":389,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":417,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":171,"reasoningTokens":246},"totalTokens":806,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":246,"promptTokenCount":389,"candidatesTokenCount":171,"totalTokenCount":806,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":389}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":171}]},"reasoningTokens":246,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4081,"keyed_label":"A"}
